@Conversions_HostAddress = http://localhost:5022

### ============================================================
### 1. HEALTH / DISCOVERY ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### Get all supported measurement categories
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all supported units (all categories)
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions/units
Accept: application/json

###

### Get units filtered by category: Length
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions/units?category=Length
Accept: application/json

###

### Get units filtered by category: Temperature
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions/units?category=Temperature
Accept: application/json

###

### Get units filtered by category: Weight
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions/units?category=Weight
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### 2. CORE CONVERSION ENDPOINTS (POST)
### ============================================================

### Convert Length: 100 meters to feet (with 2 decimal precision)
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 100,
  "sourceUnit": "meter",
  "targetUnit": "foot",
  "precision": 2
}

###

### Convert Temperature: 25 Celsius to Fahrenheit
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 25,
  "sourceUnit": "celsius",
  "targetUnit": "fahrenheit",
  "precision": 1
}

###

### Convert Weight/Mass: 75 kilograms to pounds (using aliases 'kg' and 'lbs')
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 75,
  "sourceUnit": "kg",
  "targetUnit": "lbs",
  "precision": 2
}

###

### Convert Volume: 5 liters to US gallons
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 5,
  "sourceUnit": "liter",
  "targetUnit": "gallon",
  "precision": 3
}

###

### Convert Speed: 100 km/h to mph
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 100,
  "sourceUnit": "kmh",
  "targetUnit": "mph",
  "precision": 2
}

###

### Convert Time: 2.5 hours to minutes
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 2.5,
  "sourceUnit": "hour",
  "targetUnit": "minute"
}

###

### ============================================================
### 3. CONVERSION VIA QUERY PARAMETERS (GET)
### ============================================================

### Convert via GET query: 10 miles to kilometers
GET {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions?value=10&sourceUnit=mile&targetUnit=kilometer&precision=2
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### 4. ERROR HANDLING & VALIDATION CASES
### ============================================================

### Incompatible Units (Length to Weight) -> Expects 400 Bad Request
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 100,
  "sourceUnit": "meter",
  "targetUnit": "kilogram"
}

###

### Unknown Unit -> Expects 404 Not Found
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 100,
  "sourceUnit": "lightyear",
  "targetUnit": "meter"
}

###

### Temperature below absolute zero (-300 °C) -> Expects 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": -300,
  "sourceUnit": "celsius",
  "targetUnit": "kelvin"
}

###

### Validation Error: Missing unit and negative precision -> Expects 400 Bad Request
POST {{Conversions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 50,
  "sourceUnit": "",
  "targetUnit": "meter",
  "precision": -5
}
